   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "hisim.components.<folder>\nevery multi-module component a folder; its __init__ is its public API: the component class(es), the config class(es), the names other layers address. A component imports no other component\n(interim allow-list: default connections, shared helpers until they move)",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "p-components",
   "originalText": "hisim.components.<folder>\nevery multi-module component a folder; its __init__ is its public API: the component class(es), the config class(es), the names other layers address. A component imports no other component\n(interim allow-list: default connections, shared helpers until they move)",
   "lineHeight": 1.15,
   "autoResize": true
  },
